{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12086","headline":"白石枕 · 钱起","name":"白石枕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琢珉胜水碧，所贵素且贞。\n曾无白圭玷，不作浮磬鸣。\n捧来太阳前，一片新冰清。\n沈沈风宪地，待尔秋已至。\n璞坚难爲功，谁怨晚成器。\n比德无磷缁，论交亦如此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}